Both webview attempts resolved to the SAME dead end:
  GET {baseUrl}/payment-mobile?payment_token=...&order_id=<id>&payment_method=paypal
  -> raw JSON {"response_code":"gateways_default_204","message":"information not found","content":null,"errors":[]}
  Root cause: Admin/Modules/Gateways is a closed-source 6amtech add-on, physically
  ABSENT from this repo/environment (documented standing constraint, CLAUDE.md
  "nwidart modules" section) — so no digital-gateway round trip can ever complete,
  and neither /payment-success nor /payment-fail/-cancel URLs are ever reached by
  the webview's onLoadStart/onLoadStop, which is what order_service.dart's
  paymentRedirect() pattern-matches on to route into order_successful_screen /
  digital_payment_failed_screen (full-screen) in the first place.

